Upstream-Name: cpmemu
Upstream-Contact: Aaron Wohl <xdeb@awohl.com>
Source: https://github.com/avwohl/cpmemu
Comment:
 The upstream release tarball holds tests/cpm-test as an empty directory: it
 is a git submodule (https://github.com/skx/cpm-test), and GitHub's tag
 archives leave submodules out.

Files: *
Copyright: 2025-2026 Aaron Wohl
